    "Imam al-Sadiq's Amulet\nRecite this supplicatory amulet against eye pain:\nاَعُوْذُ بِعِزَّةِ اللّٰهِ وَاَعُوْذُ بِقُوَّةِ اللّٰهِ وَاَعُوْذُ بِقُدْرَةِ اللّٰهِ وَاَعُوْذُ بِنُوْرِ اللّٰهِ وَاَعُوْذُ بِعَظَمَةِ اللّٰهِ وَاَعُوْذُ بِجَلَالِ اللّٰهِ وَاَعُوْذُ بِجَمَالِ اللّٰهِ وَاَعُوْذُ بِبَهَاۤءِ اللّٰهِ وَاَعُوْذُ بِجَمْعِ اللّٰهِ وَاَعُوْذُ بِعَفْوِ اللّٰهِ وَاَعُوْذُ بِغُفْرَانِ اللّٰهِ وَاَعُوْذُ بِرَسُوْلِ اللّٰهِ وَاَعُوْذُ بِالْاَئِمَّةِ عَلٰى مَا تَشَاۤءُ مِنْ شَرِّ مَاۤ اَجِدُ اَللّٰهُمَّ رَبَّ الْمُطِيْعِيْنَ\nA'OOZU BI-I'ZZATILLAAHI WA A'OOZU BI-QUWWATILLAAHI WA A'OOZU BI-QUDRATILLAAHI WA A'OOZU BI-NOORILLAAHI WA A'OOZU BI-A'ZAMATILLAAHI WA A'OOZU BI-JALAALILLAAHI WA A'OOZU BI-JAMAALILLAAHI WA A'OOZU BI-BAHAAA-ILLAAHI WA A'OOZU BI-JAM-I'LLAAHI WA A'OOZU BI-A'FWILLAAHI WA A'OOZU BI-GHUFRAANILLAAHI WA A'OOZU BI-RASOOLILLAAHI WA A'OOZU BIL AAA-IMMATI A'LAA MAA TASHAAA-U MIN SHARRI MAAA AJID, ALLAAHUMMA RABBAL MUTEE-E'EN\nI seek refuge in the might of Allah, and I seek refuge in the strength of Allah, and I seek refuge in the power of Allah, and I seek refuge in the light of Allah, and I seek refuge in the majesty of Allah, and I seek refuge in the glory of Allah, and I seek refuge in the beauty of Allah, and I seek refuge in the splendor of Allah, and I seek refuge in the wholeness of Allah, and I seek refuge in the pardon of Allah, and I seek refuge in the forgiveness of Allah, and I seek refuge in the Messenger of Allah, and I seek refuge in the Imams, against whatever You will of the evil that I find. O Allah, Lord of the obedient.",
    "Ayat al-Kursi for Eye Pain\nPut a hand on the eye and say:\nاُعِيْذُ نُوْرَ بَصَرِىْ بِنُوْرِ اللّٰهِ الَّذِىْ لَا يُطْفَاۤءُ\nU'EEZU NOORA BASAREE BI-NOORILLAAHIL LAZEE LAA YUTFAAA-U\nI place the light of my sight in refuge with the light of Allah, which is never extinguished.\nThen recite [Ayat al-Kursi](A4), believing inwardly that it will cure the pain.",
